                "description": "The Arched Rose Elan Leverset is available in an array of beautiful finishes. This traditional door leverset features the swirl Elan Lever with the Arched #8 rosette, for a classic look that is great for any home. This Traditional Swirl Elan Lever with Arched Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. This interior door lever will fit 1-1/4 inch to inch thick doors and is available in either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Elan Leverset with Arched Rosettes, Elan Lever with Arched Roses, Emtek 8058EN, Emtek 8108EN, Emtek 8208EN, ENT-8058EN, Traditional Elan Leversets, Traditional Elan Leversets, Elan Lever with Arched Rosettes, Traditional Elan Lever with Arched Roses, Arched Rose Elan Leversets, Elan Lever with #8 Rosettes, Traditional Swirl Elan Lever with Arched Roses, Traditional Elan Leverset with Arched #8 Rosettes,"
